current repo-root seed panel (ca_county_year_panel_sql_seed.csv) is embedded
below as regular INSERT statements. Regenerate that seed from the collected CSV
files with `python prepare_sql_seed_panel.py` when raw data change, then refresh
this embedded block before running the SQL model-prep script.
*/

